            "value" : "Rosetta Check には %lld 個のツールフォルダへの読み取り専用アクセスが必要です. クリックして「ツール」画面を開き, 確認してください."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rosetta Check needs read-only access to these %lld folders before it can inspect every command-line tool. macOS will ask you to select each folder in order:\n\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Rosetta Check needs read-only access to these %1$lld folders before it can inspect every command-line tool. macOS will ask you to select each folder in order:\n\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rosetta Check benötigt Lesezugriff auf diese %lld Ordner, bevor Rosetta Check alle Kommandozeilen-Tools prüfen kann. macOS fordert Sie auf, die Ordner nacheinander auszuwählen:\n\n%@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
